<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Eric P. Linder said he raised his rating on Apasco SA de CV to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;A 15 percent share price decline and the release of third quarter earnings over the past two weeks have significantly improved Apasco's valuation,&quot; he said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were not yet trading at 1039 EST/1439 GMT.</p>
</text>
